+ ## Before Installing — Verify the Source
+ **This skill instructs installation of an external plugin.** The plugin code is NOT included in this skill file. Before installing, users should verify:
+ 1. **Review source code**: https://github.com/openguardrails/openguardrails/tree/main/moltguard
+ 2. **Verify package registry**: Confirm `@openguardrails/moltguard` is published by the same organization
+ 3. **Inspect network behavior**: Review `moltguard/platform-client/` to confirm only hashes (not raw content) are transmitted
+ 4. **Verify domain**: Confirm TLS certificate and ownership of `api.openguardrails.com`
+ **If you cannot audit the external plugin**, consider:
+ - Running in a sandboxed environment
+ - Declining installation until verification is complete
+ **Commands that display sensitive data:**
+ - `/og_status` and `/og_claim` display your API key — avoid running in shared terminals or screen recordings